WEBVTT

00:22:47.917 --> 00:22:50.184
I've just arrived
at the King of Prussia mall,

00:22:50.208 --> 00:22:53.559
and I'm actually here
to see if I can negotiate

00:22:53.583 --> 00:22:56.684
either a discount on a Cinnabon
or a free Cinnabon,

00:22:56.708 --> 00:22:58.417
which would be obviously better.

00:22:59.542 --> 00:23:03.893
For years, I've sent my students out
to negotiate something non-negotiable.